        {
          "type": "h2",
          "text": "THE SITUATION"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "A damp-proofing contractor whose Google Ads delivered a handful of expensive enquiries a month and a lot of calls from people outside its area."
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "A single campaign, one ad group, broad match, landing on the home page. Half the calls were from counties the contractor did not cover."
        },
        {
          "type": "h2",
          "text": "WHAT WE CHANGED"
        },
        {
          "type": "ol",
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Campaigns by problem: rising damp, condensation, basement tanking, each with its own page",
              "href": null,
              "imgs": []
            },
            {
              "text": "Strict location targeting with county-level bid adjustments",
              "href": null,
              "imgs": []
            },
            {
              "text": "A survey booking page with a three-step form and before-and-after photos",
              "href": null,
              "imgs": []
            },
            {
              "text": "Call tracking with a short qualifying script for the office",
              "href": null,
              "imgs": []
            },
            {
              "text": "Negative keyword lists rebuilt weekly from search terms",
              "href": null,
              "imgs": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "h2",
          "text": "WHAT HAPPENED"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "Cost per lead fell from €61 to €24 and the contractor books nearly six times more surveys a month on a smaller budget."
        }
      ]
    },
